--- errno ESTRPIPE: Streams pipe error.
public estrpipe: atom
--- errno EUSERS: Too many users.
public eusers: atom
--- errno ENOTSOCK: Socket operation on non-socket.
public enotsock: atom
--- errno EDESTADDRREQ: Destination address required.
