public enoprotoopt: atom
--- errno EPROTONOSUPPORT: Protocol not supported.
public eprotonosupport: atom
--- errno ESOCKTNOSUPPORT: Socket type not supported.
public esocktnosupport: atom
--- errno EOPNOTSUPP: Operation not supported on transport endpoint.
public eopnotsupp: atom
--- errno EPFNOSUPPORT: Protocol family not supported.
public epfnosupport: atom
--- errno EAFNOSUPPORT: Address family not supported by protocol.
public eafnosupport: atom
--- errno EADDRINUSE: Address already in use.
public eaddrinuse: atom
--- errno EADDRNOTAVAIL: Cannot assign requested address.
public eaddrnotavail: atom
--- errno ENETDOWN: Network is down.
public enetdown: atom
--- errno ENETUNREACH: Network is unreachable.
public enetunreach: atom
